/dist/
/paper/

# Golden corpus: fixtures and expected output are large and local-only, and a
# document may only be redistributed with confirmation (AGENTS.md). The tests
# skip when they are absent, so a checkout without them still passes.
/tests/fixtures/
/tests/expected/
